flowchart TD
    A((Start)) --> B[Receive JSON request]
    B --> C{Valid object, non-empty string, <= 4000 chars?}
    C -->|No| D[Return 400]
    C -->|Yes| E[Persist processing request]
    E --> F{Database insert succeeded?}
    F -->|No| G[Return 503; do not classify]
    F -->|Yes| H[Classify into configured set]
    H --> I[Checker validates classification structure]
    I --> J{Recoverable classification error?}
    J -->|Yes and attempt < 2| K[Pass checker feedback to next attempt]
    K --> H
    J -->|No or attempts exhausted| L[Mark pending review; do not route]
    I --> M[Validate allowlist, confidence, and review flags]
    M --> N[Checker verifies validation invariants]
    N --> O{Valid known category and no review?}
    O -->|No| L
    O -->|Yes| P[Select fixed workflow]
    P --> Q[Checker verifies canonical category route]
    Q --> R{Route is canonical?}
    R -->|No| S[Record failure; do not execute]
    R -->|Yes| T[Run registered workflow]
    T --> U[Checker validates structured result]
    U --> V{Execution and result valid?}
    V -->|No| S
    V -->|Yes| W[Persist completed request and trace]
    L --> X{Human action}
    X -->|Approve eligible supported category| Y[Check canonical route and execute tracked workflow]
    X -->|Reject| Z[Persist rejected state]
    X -->|Clarify| AA[Persist awaiting_clarification state]
    Y --> AB[Checker validates review and execution]
    D --> AC((End))
    G --> AC
    S --> AC
    W --> AC
    AB --> AC
    Z --> AC
    AA --> AC
